{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16108050","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16108050","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1610805001:1":{"text":"I just get more nervous the closer we get... My palms are sweating, and my heart is racing!","source_cn":"我……越临近考试我越觉得紧张，现在我的手出了好多汗，心...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8565286D9F699C49","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1610805001":{"text":"I just get more nervous the closer we get... My palms are sweating, and my heart is racing!","source_cn":"我……越临近考试我越觉得紧张，现在我的手出了好多汗，心也在怦怦跳！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8565286D9F699C49","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1610805002:0":{"text":"Pippa, just breathe. You've got this. It'd be a shame to mess up just because you're panicking.","source_cn":"皮帕，你别慌，深呼吸一下平复心情。要是因为紧张害怕而失...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4E6C5A8DAE6A828","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1610805003:0":{"text":"I... I just keep seeing the headmaster collapse.","source_cn":"我、我脑子里总想着那天校长一下子倒在地上的情景。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E61043ABFAC7277","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1610805004:0":{"text":"And that interrogation with Envoy Evie... She was polite, but I was still terrified.","source_cn":"还有审查所的审讯……虽然伊芙特使态度很好，可我就是不由...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E9AD6A5476C95F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1610805005:1":{"text":"I get it. I was right there when the headmaster fell.","source_cn":"我理解……校长倒下的时候，我就在他身边。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11756E5AB8460C56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1610805006:1":{"text":"It's alright, guys. Nothing to worry about. Envoy Evie confirmed it had nothing to do with you. Just put it out of your mind.","source_cn":"好了，休，皮帕，没事了。伊芙特使不是已经调查清楚了吗，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21AC95074C5D104B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1610805007:1":{"text":"Don't get stuck being scared. Focus on today's exam.","source_cn":"与其一直沉浸在恐慌里，不如想想今天的选拔赛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x564CA3414D2D3E03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1610805008:1":{"text":"This is the last round of the preliminaries. Get through this, and you're in the finals. Don't lose your focus now.","source_cn":"今天可是初赛的最后关卡了，只要通过就能晋级决赛，你们可...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7ABB1968833AB843","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1610805009:1":{"text":"Hey, I heard a rumor today's test involves transfiguration!","source_cn":"对了，我听说今天的选拔赛要用到变形术！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18ABABF765A8DA28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1610805010:1":{"text":"Transfiguration? What does a court mage need that for?","source_cn":"变形术？宫廷魔法师需要变形？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEED090DB3D4ED758","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1610805011:1":{"text":"Everyone, sorry to interrupt... the judges will be arriving shortly, so please gather over here first.","source_cn":"各位，不好意思，打断一下……今天比赛的评委马上就要来了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7EB417D7A91FAC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:0:1":{"text":"I'm pretty nervous too.","source_cn":"我也很紧张","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x43F088E7211FD9F6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I'm pretty nervous too.","female":"I'm pretty nervous too.","variant_male_record_index":"81797","variant_female_record_index":"81798","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:1:2":{"text":"I'm feeling calm, actually.","source_cn":"我倒是感觉很平静","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x225AC8FF2086E316","variant_status":"ru